CRITICAL INSTRUCTIONS:
- Extract ACTUAL requirement IDs, story IDs, and rule IDs from the upstream documents. Do not invent placeholder IDs — reference the real ones from the documents provided.
- The gap analysis must be honest — if requirements are missing test coverage, flag it.
- Every business objective must trace all the way to at least one test scenario.
- The traceability health score must reflect reality, not optimism.
- Cross-document dependencies must show how changes cascade across the documentation set.
- Think about what would break if a single requirement changed — trace the impact.

